				<img height="283" src="img/spinosaurus_vignette027_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/nonmaker/KPG/spinosaurus_vignette/img/spinosaurus_vignette027.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
